                  <nc xml:id="m-5baeaf3b-9afa-4147-8218-c18ca4aa4439" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-d789e344-7980-4f50-b76e-ed8466e0a438">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-19640a9e-1c8d-44fc-b536-9e9b72ca824f" type="clivis" xml:id="m-01b7b8e6-0a63-4e1d-a283-1bb4a4f61ed9">
                  <nc xml:id="m-e1677403-d33c-4717-b802-16c2c578df14" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-d567b440-4df4-413c-b002-f89887756d2e" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-4d576fe0-5a60-4fde-8faa-2dd3b4215229">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-09048f7e-6f6f-4f29-b73f-870e75ba02f2" type="punctum" xml:id="m-5c459b3a-b357-4bc0-808c-cc02e51b242c">
                  <nc xml:id="m-e753f46f-c84d-4174-8697-b01b0bf10089" pname="d" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-fa3d074b-2564-4340-a4fd-ab10a2bf839a" facs="#m-0f57f254-3f59-40b3-a305-930ba0dd7b72" pname="d" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-4129fa97-908a-4909-99d1-1e3841f108a3"><lg xml:id="m-69b6380b-0b20-4d10-9c5f-4ca687efff2e"><l xml:id="m-74d5a6dd-7c7c-47ab-bae4-4b8163c65005" facs="#m-61827cab-b889-4bbe-9268-562aaa283b6c" label="ambiguous">1526</l><l xml:id="m-f470e2fb-79ea-408c-b91f-eabb66f03760" facs="#m-7cbb814d-c2a8-403f-9462-474d76197245" label="ambiguous">Iune 30.</l><l xml:id="m-49e5adbd-fd7f-4ab1-ad11-8f0931546f50" facs="#m-dcf92f54-d5ae-48ac-a1c1-b1f425ddd564" label="text-like">30. Commemoration of St. Paul, Apostle.</l><l xml:id="m-674023b7-086c-4eea-baf8-302642fee0cf" facs="#m-a877b2ab-a217-4223-984b-bc965fc25206" label="ambiguous">Double Major.</l><l xml:id="m-f475c006-ca99-4335-b973-bc194e559236" facs="#m-c1654e22-b0bd-47a2-a9fc-d36c02fc333c" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Ego plantávi. p. 1348. Short Lesson. Ego enim.</l><l xml:id="m-f31ac1a3-55a4-47f4-99b3-7369d7551b1a" facs="#m-963ee7e7-79c9-4d0c-910a-e35c2c53ddaf" label="ambiguous">1527.</l><l xml:id="m-f481e162-e703-42cf-b6f2-24f5cefd7f14" facs="#m-334c6c46-df85-4efb-8c9d-3c32b85abc06" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-c55f512d-63cd-4602-b7d1-1d20328ac497" facs="#m-57c055a4-416a-446a-a188-2bdcb2e72d51" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Libénter gloriábor. D. 1348. Chapter. Bonum certámen. as at first</l><l xml:id="m-5b947da5-763b-414b-964e-26902f344b9f" facs="#m-b41b438f-3c03-46b8-a679-e90080cecb06" label="lyrics-like">Vespers, p. 1525. Short Resp. In ómnem térram. D. 1518. V. Constitues.</l><l xml:id="m-d5dd5db2-04b6-431d-828b-f252d406f0de" facs="#m-d6294826-0095-439d-90f6-0aaa7952e5fc" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-6661f158-2d17-4746-b0ad-faff7f4316ba" facs="#m-d58d9929-4c22-45a3-b61c-7b558cf398e2" label="lyrics-like">Introit. Scio cúi crédidi. D. 1344.</l><l xml:id="m-2eed391a-7a7a-4ac1-88e3-422afa72b813" facs="#m-a4d727df-5341-4ee3-b7e8-8d7e6d800ba1" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-cf2f5126-db80-4a2d-8a98-3c1883ef3bef" facs="#m-3f87554e-e17e-43be-9358-2e7b5d6d1e5d" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui multitúdinem géntium! mus; ut, cujus natalitia cólimus,</l><l xml:id="m-13310d75-b473-479b-9d84-160b18dd937a" facs="#m-5a8de250-e00b-47f4-9c96-8dfeefb94634" label="lyrics-like">I beáti Pauli Apóstoli praedica-l ejus apud té patrocinia sentiámus.</l><l xml:id="m-4fba2853-8070-492d-b062-28cbdcc2c89f" facs="#m-67dc2f51-1823-452f-a23d-f24f031ec20b" label="lyrics-like">tione docuisti:t da nobis, quaésu-lPer Dominum.</l><l xml:id="m-dec52648-f202-4efc-bc8a-27f9967e96e3" facs="#m-ca235744-ca43-4626-90e5-2f109b28f438" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of St. Peter. Collect. Deus qui beáto Petro. p. 1831.</l><l xml:id="m-241bae09-e111-4f60-aad0-9eeab00d6ce3" facs="#m-a636115f-6e24-43dc-9a25-1404ea07bb7e" label="lyrics-like">Comm. of the Octave of St. John. Collect. Deus, qui praeséntem. p. 1500.</l><l xml:id="m-27035cdd-40c2-49db-bbbc-cf114356335c" facs="#m-0377c844-37d5-44ea-aa95-8d10dd9073bd" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Galatas Gal. T. b.</l><l xml:id="m-a63b9bf1-27b0-4a96-bcd4-698960ea188d" facs="#m-35927264-4ab6-4656-8afa-9fcc6b73820a" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratres: Notum vobis fácio! cávit per grátiam suam, ut revelá¬</l><l xml:id="m-c322ecf1-a23c-41a7-8260-f69dbbbf0734" facs="#m-5f06ce1c-8c91-40f5-b67c-7f56c6d54a3a" label="lyrics-like">Evangélium, quod evangelizá¬</l><l xml:id="m-06563b1a-5310-46d9-8a41-b8c373f3b6cd" facs="#m-f577a5e2-d55a-4a29-a729-154965770e4b" label="ambiguous">ret Filium suum in me, ut evanze¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f3deee5-b47e-4ab6-a057-0d5947c48421" facs="#m-4c9ecbe4-5d89-41cb-b0e4-39a39acbc7b2" label="lyrics-like">lizárem illum in géntibus: continuo</l><l xml:id="m-f50220ec-cb28-4361-b29e-5d46e97cd949" facs="#m-31b20e9a-7d75-4da4-bbae-122d5a23316d" label="lyrics-like">tum est a me, quià non est secún¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3837046-9031-4b0c-8a5a-a6a59792a069" facs="#m-687f2f84-af44-4272-b108-1b4e231d7540" label="lyrics-like">non acquiévi carni et sánguini,</l><l xml:id="m-03c83e9e-bf33-438c-af70-f0d0836e1175" facs="#m-6d4f7480-c4ef-4274-8ed8-d211d5e19abd" label="lyrics-like">dum hóminem: neque enim ego ab</l><l xml:id="m-e25d6ebc-78f6-4bde-9b54-1d9e5737c6e8" facs="#m-be64ccbb-ea19-48f7-bff8-0a0885d000ae" label="lyrics-like">hómine accépi illud neque didici,</l><l xml:id="m-a18717fa-209e-4c50-a0cf-be3fca01a5a6" facs="#m-fa3d911f-5127-4ec6-9a52-0ea163cb3311" label="lyrics-like">neque veni Jerosólymam ad ante¬</l><l xml:id="m-38055970-7463-4095-b3d8-fa75ab577091" facs="#m-c8d88143-4081-4c23-8931-df119babb7aa" label="lyrics-like">sed per revelatiónem Jesu Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-41394f2e-1063-438d-9de3-56e544f9e95f" facs="#m-25b286e6-dfc0-42a7-917a-fda3ebc54882" label="lyrics-like">cessóres meõs Apóstolos : sed ábii</l><l xml:id="m-949a013a-c395-49c7-bf18-20c87080a9e0" facs="#m-e9e6b738-92f5-4cd0-8ec5-e7e31e8230e9" label="lyrics-like">in Arábiam: et iterum revérsus sum</l><l xml:id="m-11458cef-1575-4b35-b902-544984ecd06d" facs="#m-c5b1f8f6-5397-4416-896f-9a8e59a678d9" label="lyrics-like">Audístis enim conversatiónem meam</l><l xml:id="m-cd5b8766-58b9-4daf-b441-b5ae670fe5d4" facs="#m-064e69bf-8868-4377-b344-7914cd749889" label="lyrics-like">aliquándo in Judaismo: quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-5207a741-5976-4904-b357-461202c33e22" facs="#m-640f9cfe-b543-4e2b-878a-73cd4cc9f452" label="lyrics-like">Damáscum: deinde post annos</l><l xml:id="m-fed59ec2-29bf-418a-8da2-5cc2b59af4b0" facs="#m-c084ea5a-1695-46af-bdbf-ac5041a1332e" label="lyrics-like">supra modum persequébar Ecclé¬</l><l xml:id="m-38341c3f-f3b1-450c-ac03-ffc7d3e4b8a8" facs="#m-186aaeed-3616-4148-af4a-239c2f753bb1" label="lyrics-like">tres veni Jerosólymam vidére Pe¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5f9d34a-aa3b-4006-bd11-5bff6f4d14d8" facs="#m-f8d9ed58-d466-450a-b335-cad25266cd8c" label="lyrics-like">siam Dei, et expugnábam illam, et</l><l xml:id="m-1c953408-db48-43e5-b85b-75b41b3ad000" facs="#m-4e40bce7-751c-4b8a-b2bc-e3f31bd9f07c" label="lyrics-like">trum, et mansi apud eum diébus</l><l xml:id="m-0095d695-10cc-43df-8445-55f2bc94eebe" facs="#m-6f6a5fbd-ad3f-4390-9819-f05d1bc8519a" label="lyrics-like">proficiébam in Judaismo supra mul¬</l><l xml:id="m-838fcdbf-4fd4-4958-b593-8f8f3bbf6194" facs="#m-c2156e29-5b46-4b8c-8401-71155ea6aa7f" label="lyrics-like">quíndecim: álium autem Aposto¬</l><l xml:id="m-45edf667-0fba-429d-b221-a3c562354ee5" facs="#m-8173f832-f325-4def-9e5d-38071f46bf23" label="lyrics-like">tórum vidi néminem, nisi Jacóbum</l><l xml:id="m-7c6fc0b3-b13e-4a4a-a54d-619e4b406f4e" facs="#m-fa93b623-6568-48cd-a2a9-a17c42c9d829" label="lyrics-like">tos coaetáneos meos in génere meo,</l><l xml:id="m-7b92dc4e-7ca6-4550-8cac-1596a0032f2a" facs="#m-bd5d7713-f7b4-4bfc-8365-dc0c3cfb7b81" label="lyrics-like">abundántius aemulátor exsístens</l><l xml:id="m-3a6ca118-acb3-45a9-abeb-70b907d92c77" facs="#m-9de9eb79-c27e-47e1-ac5a-4c883dc1a98a" label="lyrics-like">fratrem Dómini. Quae autem scribo</l><l xml:id="m-89ff03c3-acf1-4a87-be79-31a87396efb0" facs="#m-88af82d7-2397-4f69-8604-e9f2742eec1b" label="ambiguous">vobis, ecce coram Deo, quia non</l><l xml:id="m-1cda4fca-bf74-4c31-a115-134d7c590690" facs="#m-f0d1a9d0-3143-4849-ae75-544ded1ebb8e" label="lyrics-like">paternárum meárum traditiónum.</l><l xml:id="m-16d801d9-24c9-49ae-a570-d2da2d1e881d" facs="#m-8a282856-db96-4ad0-9b19-96b10a310fa7" label="lyrics-like">Cum autem plácuit ei, qui me segre-Iméntior.</l><l xml:id="m-9e8bf55f-d86a-4098-9526-6c414c92947d" facs="#m-d1b34f36-76dc-4cc9-a1f8-6eb6aef4227a" label="lyrics-like">gávit ex útero matris meae, et vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c6fb74e-1bf8-4bfa-802e-a3108645964a" facs="#m-b98c42e6-9294-4da2-ab26-c191e5c44792" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Qui operátus est. p. 1345.</l><l xml:id="m-1b34de20-d4c5-4ac8-a5af-d6e0bba04660" facs="#m-34edd53e-0bba-450d-bd91-9fce0746852c" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-e5e260a2-06de-40fb-92b0-c877c907a553" facs="#m-8429179a-4f02-4f8b-bdd1-9d85ba2383fe" label="lyrics-like">HLle-lú-ia¬</l><l xml:id="m-c7a8f0a0-8ea4-4a18-8a8a-80bbd1b6460e" facs="#m-5e556733-a8a8-4240-a861-e6561c87f81f" label="ambiguous">ij.</l><l xml:id="m-39463597-23d2-4c9c-9626-ce596a05c62e" facs="#m-db6312d9-d761-4661-bc8b-b35c1afdfb31" label="lyrics-like">V. Sáncte Páu¬</l><l xml:id="m-fc8af9e2-2a0e-49aa-9a9b-6a3e018a1a96" facs="#m-03abd7c5-348e-4f90-a1fc-51d741986ad4" label="ambiguous">le</l><l xml:id="m-6b854ccd-9344-4802-b04a-21311b0d65dc" facs="#m-fdaaa6d4-5bf1-41c7-a2bb-3fccc9c7d681" label="lyrics-like">Apósto¬</l><l xml:id="m-be516310-62fe-41e8-b435-2859442fb4fc" facs="#m-f9cbe386-1826-4e92-b8e0-d79884794df6" label="lyrics-like">le, praedi-cá-tor</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>